<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Caixa cuts prime to 9.375 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Caixa cuts prime to 9.375 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Caixa de Depositos said on Thursday that it was cutting its prime lending rate by 0.25 of a percentage point to 9.375 percent, effective January 27.  </p>
<p>The prime rates of other major banks stand at between 10.75 and 10.875 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
